rs.", "PERROS P:Perros P is a medical professional who plays a significant role in the development of guidelines for the management of thyroid cancer. They are recognized as an author of the Guidelines for the management of thyroid cancer, which were published in the journal Clin Endocrinol. Through their contributions, Perros P has helped shape the standards and practices for treating this condition.", "VERDE G:Verde G is a researcher who has studied ultrasound-guided percutaneous ethanol injection in the treatment of cystic thyroid nodules.", "PUNCIÓN ASPIRATIVA CON AGUJA FINA:Fine-needle aspiration (PAAF) is a procedure recommended for evaluating thyroid nodules suspected of malignancy.", "BOCIO DIFUSO NO TÓXICO:BOCIO DIFUSO NO TÓXICO, or diffuse non-toxic goiter, is a condition characterized by an enlarged thyroid gland that occurs without the presence of toxic symptoms. This condition is often associated with iodine deficiency or other factors that impede the synthesis of thyroid hormones. It represents an adaptive process of the thyroid in response to these challenges, reflecting the gland's efforts to maintain hormonal balance despite the difficulties in hormone production.", "DEFICIENCIA DE YODO:La deficiencia de yodo es un factor limitante en la síntesis de hormonas tiroideas y se asocia con la presencia de bocio en la población.", "PUNCIÓN ASPIRATIVA CON AGUJA FINA (PAAF):La PAAF es un procedimiento utilizado en el estudio de nódulos tiroideos basado en su tamaño y sospecha de malignidad.", "NÓDULO TIROIDEO:", "TIRADS:The Thyroid Imaging Reporting and Data System (TIRADS) is a system used to stratify the risk of malignancy in thyroid nodules based on ultrasound features.", "BIBLE KC:Bible KC is an author who has contributed to the American Thyroid Association Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer.", "DOHERTY GM:Doherty GM is an author of the American Thyroid Association Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer. This involvement highlights Doherty GM's significant contribution to the field of thyroid health, particularly in providing evidence-based recommendations for the management of thyroid nodules and differentiated thyroid cancer in adult patients.", "NIKIFOROV YE:Nikiforov YE is an author of the American Thyroid Association Management Guidelines for Adult Patients with Thyroid Nodules and Differentiated Thyroid Cancer. He has contributed to the development of these guidelines, which serve as a critical resource for the management of thyroid conditions in adult patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}